I also added error handling using try/catch blocks for the `generateAnalysis` and `postEverythingToFirebase` functions to make sure that any errors are properly caught and logged.

Finally, I added async/await to the `handleGenerateAnalysis` function to make sure that the `postEverythingToFirebase` function waits for the `generateAnalysis` function to complete before moving on to the next step.

